ps://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322278\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322898\n", "files": ["dom/base/nsGlobalWindowOuter.cpp", "dom/clients/manager/ClientOpenWindowUtils.cpp", "dom/documentpip/DocumentPictureInPicture.cpp", "gfx/vr/nsFxrCommandLineHandler.cpp", "layout/tools/layout-debug/src/nsLayoutDebugCLH.cpp", "security/manager/pki/nsNSSDialogHelper.cpp", "security/manager/ssl/nsNSSCallbacks.cpp", "toolkit/components/alerts/nsXULAlerts.cpp", "toolkit/components/windowwatcher/nsIWindowWatcher.idl", "toolkit/components/windowwatcher/nsPIWindowWatcher.idl", "toolkit/components/windowwatcher/nsWindowWatcher.cpp", "toolkit/components/windowwatcher/nsWindowWatcher.h", "toolkit/xre/ProfileReset.cpp", "toolkit/xre/nsAppRunner.cpp", "widget/android/nsWindow.cpp", "widget/uikit/nsWindow.mm", "widget/windows/nsPrintDialogWin.cpp"], "git_node": "a1968e3b2eabbaeccc2db1c04c2067c1c1503141", "git_parents": ["c719543af6c4334d783dea56c578bdc84dcfb60b"], "node": "077f5e2b59ba5971d2839a46f9aefbcf5ec73a70", "parents": ["6a8d9776a956c2b727339139c047ac2448efe05e"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789316664, "git_changesets": ["a1968e3b2eabbaeccc2db1c04c2067c1c1503141"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "529": {"changesets": [{"author": "Jan de Mooij \u003cjdemooij@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2067030 - Don't dispose enclosing scope's resources when leaving a for-of loop.  a=pascalc\n\nWhen a for-of loop's head had no lexical declaration of its own (eg `for (x of y)`),\nleaving the loop via break/continue/return incorrectly disposed the resources of\nthe scope enclosing the loop.\n\nIn `ForOfLoopControl::emitIteratorCloseForNonLocalExits` we now use the same condition\nas `emitEndCodeNeedingIteratorClose`.\n\nThis also adds a number of tests, some failed without this patch. We now match a\nV8 shell for all of these cases.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321815\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322877\n", "files": ["js/src/frontend/EmitterScope.h", "js/src/frontend/ForOfLoopControl.cpp", "js/src/frontend/UsingEmitter.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/explicit-resource-management/for-of-non-local-exit-async.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/explicit-resource-management/for-of-non-local-exit.js"], "git_node": "a3a5f00828e027d922f3dea5ec17cc424e26e142", "git_parents": ["a1968e3b2eabbaeccc2db1c04c2067c1c1503141"], "node": "54e07e27b64c393e142ccfce6623660d202753df", "parents": ["077f5e2b59ba5971d2839a46f9aefbcf5ec73a70"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789316755, "git_changesets": ["a3a5f00828e027d922f3dea5ec17cc424e26e142"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "530": {"changesets": [{"author": "Gijs Kruitbosch \u003cgijskruitbosch@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2043115 - fix modifier/middle clicks on nested links without an href attribute,  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321514\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323208\n", "files": ["browser/base/content/test/linkHandling/browser.toml", "browser/base/content/test/linkHandling/browser_nested_hrefless_links.js", "toolkit/modules/BrowserUtils.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "da700b11abb3a0812be8c57f8f03523a5f142370", "git_parents": ["a3a5f00828e027d922f3dea5ec17cc424e26e142"], "node": "eaf00962837aa00048816f99764e7669516033d8", "parents": ["54e07e27b64c393e142ccfce6623660d202753df"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789316813, "git_changesets": ["da700b11abb3a0812be8c57f8f03523a5f142370"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "531": {"changesets": [{"author": "Tom Schuster \u003ctschuster@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066321 - Update nonceable attribute checks for link elements.  a=pascalc\n\nPending PR: https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-csp/pull/810\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D322966\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323571\n", "files": ["dom/security/nsContentSecurityUtils.cpp", "testing/web-platform/meta/content-security-policy/script-src/non-nonceable-elements.html.ini"], "git_node": "aa6cfd2887634eb460fbc14e66b45216e07951be", "git_parents": ["da700b11abb3a0812be8c57f8f03523a5f142370"], "node": "3166dad7449873095fc44a1082bdca9730e726b2", "parents": ["eaf00962837aa00048816f99764e7669516033d8"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789316862, "git_changesets": ["aa6cfd2887634eb460fbc14e66b45216e07951be"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "532": {"changesets": [{"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2066019.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D321246\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323563\n", "files": ["browser/components/places/content/controller.js", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser_toolbar_drop_bookmarklet.js", "browser/components/places/tests/browser/browser_toolbar_drop_multiple_with_bookmarklet.js"], "git_node": "f310ef3576ac28bf88a700a461ebc924a09059eb", "git_parents": ["aa6cfd2887634eb460fbc14e66b45216e07951be"], "node": "04d79bcb9134ed278c9149f2538cdab97f0a3363", "parents": ["3166dad7449873095fc44a1082bdca9730e726b2"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789316961, "git_changesets": ["f310ef3576ac28bf88a700a461ebc924a09059eb"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "533": {"changesets": [{"author": "Marco Bonardo \u003cmbonardo@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2054767.  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D323054\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324000\n", "files": ["toolkit/actors/ContentMetaChild.sys.mjs", "toolkit/actors/ContentMetaParent.sys.mjs"], "git_node": "f797454545101d3c6ebb17b2c024c9cffb47a336", "git_parents": ["f310ef3576ac28bf88a700a461ebc924a09059eb"], "node": "3013dc261f265ae4be6c74ce28f22fb1af066b3f", "parents": ["04d79bcb9134ed278c9149f2538cdab97f0a3363"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789317010, "git_changesets": ["f797454545101d3c6ebb17b2c024c9cffb47a336"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "534": {"changesets": [{"author": "Edgar Chen \u003cechen@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2062903 - Don't allow system principal in ContentParent::RecvGetClipboardDataSnapshot;  a=pascalc\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D319200\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324011\n", "files": ["accessible/tests/browser/text/head.js", "dom/ipc/ContentParent.cpp", "widget/tests/clipboard_helper.js", "widget/tests/file_test_clipboard_getDataSnapshot.js", "widget/tests/test_clipboard_getDataSnapshot.html", "widget/tests/test_clipboard_getDataSnapshotSync.html"], "git_node": "85f847f11af353ec951d0ceae4503dc49ec16a48", "git_parents": ["f797454545101d3c6ebb17b2c024c9cffb47a336"], "node": "b102160c1b376720afa061ab5a4626ea4859048b", "parents": ["3013dc261f265ae4be6c74ce28f22fb1af066b3f"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789317063, "git_changesets": ["85f847f11af353ec951d0ceae4503dc49ec16a48"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "535": {"changesets": [{"author": "Yoshi Cheng-Hao Huang \u003callstars.chh@gmail.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2068343 - ESR153: Don't clear a module's ScriptSlot while its top-level-await generator is suspended.  a=pascalc\n\nonTopLevelEvaluationFinished clears ScriptSlot so the BaseScript can be\ncollected, but a module's evaluation can finish while its top-level-await\ngenerator is still suspended. The pending await reaction resumes the generator\nafterwards and the assertion of script() fails because it has been cleared.\n\nKeep the slot in that case, and clear it once the generator is closed, so the\nscript is still released.\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324096\n", "files": ["js/src/builtin/ModuleObject.cpp", "js/src/jit-test/tests/modules/bug-2068343-1.js", "js/src/jit-test/tests/modules/bug-2068343-2.js", "js/src/vm/GeneratorObject.cpp", "js/src/vm/GeneratorObject.h"], "git_node": "96c69884f9eb89bb5c05c6e13d9fbe9d13bb8263", "git_parents": ["85f847f11af353ec951d0ceae4503dc49ec16a48"], "node": "fdad2d2621f071d45ec436205f3f45228c51de5a", "parents": ["b102160c1b376720afa061ab5a4626ea4859048b"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789317146, "git_changesets": ["96c69884f9eb89bb5c05c6e13d9fbe9d13bb8263"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "536": {"changesets": [{"author": "Haik Aftandilian \u003chaftandilian@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Bug 2061009 - Set default browser triggers two prompts on macOS 27 r!#mac-reviewers  a=pascalc\n\nUse -[NSWorkspace setDefaultApplicationAtURL:toOpenURLsWithScheme:] instead of\nLSSetDefaultHandlerForURLScheme() and LSSetDefaultRoleHandlerForContentType() to\nset the default browser on macOS 27+. We already use NSWorkspace this way to set\nthe default PDF handler.\n\nOn macOS 27 Beta, with LSSetDefaultHandlerForURLScheme() and\nLSSetDefaultRoleHandlerForContentType(), each call generates a confirmation\nprompt resulting in multiple prompts when the \"Make default\" button is pressed.\n\nThe NSWorkspace API is available on macOS 12+, but limit it to macOS 27+ for now\nto be conservative.\n\nOriginal Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D317309\n\nDifferential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D324457\n", "files": ["browser/components/shell/nsMacShellService.cpp"], "git_node": "b3aa26e7000a295615cf033624416310cc9ab7ef", "git_parents": ["96c69884f9eb89bb5c05c6e13d9fbe9d13bb8263"], "node": "ff8cada3295b1af4910d599387b403b3e7f6244d", "parents": ["fdad2d2621f071d45ec436205f3f45228c51de5a"], "tags": []}], "date": 1789317334, "git_changesets": ["b3aa26e7000a295615cf033624416310cc9ab7ef"], "user": "pchevrel@mozilla.com"}, "537": {"changesets": [{"author": "Pascal Chevrel \u003cpascal@mozilla.com\u003e", "branch": "default", "desc": "Revert \"Bug 2061009 - Set default browser triggers two prompts on macOS 27 r!#mac